WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.986
Kip was laughing.

2
00:00:04.987 --> 00:00:07.755
He was very loud.

3
00:00:07.756 --> 00:00:18.608
Bird could not sleep.

4
00:00:18.609 --> 00:00:24.400
"Please be quiet, Kip," said Bird.

5
00:00:24.401 --> 00:00:27.794
"Sorry!" said Kip.

6
00:00:27.795 --> 00:00:34.807
Kip read some more.

7
00:00:34.808 --> 00:00:38.609
"Ha-ha!" Kip laughed.

8
00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:42.176
Bird tossed and turned.

9
00:00:42.177 --> 00:00:45.678
"Ha-ha!" Kip laughed.

10
00:00:45.679 --> 00:00:49.198
Bird covered her ears.

11
00:00:49.199 --> 00:00:56.541
"Ugh," she said. "I can't sleep.

12
00:00:56.542 --> 00:00:59.126
Kip is keeping me awake!"

13
00:00:59.127 --> 00:01:02.818
Bird flew up to Kip's hole.

14
00:01:02.819 --> 00:01:05.762
"Kip," said Bird.

15
00:01:05.763 --> 00:01:09.542
"I'm trying to—"

16
00:01:09.543 --> 00:01:16.093
"Ha-ha!" Kip laughed.

17
00:01:16.094 --> 00:01:19.124
"Hey, Bird," said Kip.

18
00:01:19.125 --> 00:01:21.908
"This book is so funny!

19
00:01:21.909 --> 00:01:24.416
Here, read this part."

20
00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:28.997
Kip gave the book to Bird.

21
00:01:28.998 --> 00:01:32.809
Bird read.

22
00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:43.592
"Ha-ha!" Bird laughed. "That is funny!"

23
00:01:43.593 --> 00:01:51.190
Bird sat down.

24
00:01:51.191 --> 00:01:56.524
She ate some popcorn.

25
00:01:56.525 --> 00:01:59.466
Bird read some more.

26
00:01:59.467 --> 00:02:03.716
"Ha-ha!" Bird laughed.

27
00:02:03.717 --> 00:02:07.526
"Where did you get this book?" she asked.

28
00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:10.258
Kip didn't answer.

29
00:02:10.259 --> 00:02:16.829
"Kip?" said Bird.

30
00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:20.124
Bird looked at Kip.

31
00:02:20.125 --> 00:02:28.855
He was asleep in his bed.

